  description: '3 Fiend and/or Fairy monsters in your GY

    Monsters in your leftmost
    or rightmost Main Monster Zones cannot be destroyed by card effects. You can
    only use each of the following effects of "Luce the Dusk''s Dark" once per turn.
    You can target 1 card your opponent controls; send 1 Fiend or Fairy monster from
    your Deck to the GY, and if you do, destroy that card. If another card(s) you
    control is destroyed by card effect (except during the Damage Step): You can
    target 1 card on the field; destroy it.'
